sequenceDiagram
  participant UI as Dashboard UI
  participant API as Dashboard API
  participant GW as Gateway
  participant AG as Agent
  participant PI as Pipeline instance

  AG->>GW: connect (wss, agent token)
  AG->>GW: hello (agent id, version, pipelines)
  GW-->>AG: welcome
  Note over GW,AG: connection stays open, pings every 20 s

  UI->>API: GET /projects/{project_id}/api/v1alpha3/pipelines/{pipeline_id}/graph
  API->>GW: GET /api/v1alpha3/pipelines/{pipeline_id}/graph + user id
  GW->>AG: request id=42
  alt no pipeline instance running
    AG->>PI: start process
    loop until ready or timeout
      AG->>PI: readiness check
    end
  end
  AG->>PI: GET /api/v1alpha3/pipelines/{pipeline_id}/graph
  PI-->>AG: 200 graph
  AG-->>GW: response id=42: 200 graph
  GW-->>API: 200 graph
  API-->>UI: 200 graph
